    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***APPEALLING TO INVESTORS***UNCAPPED RENT **POSITIVE PROPERTY*** are proud to present this well-located one-bedroom apartment, situated within the secure and sought-after Viking Harbour development on Usher's Island in Dublin 8, a short stroll from Dublin city centre. This first floor apartment offers a rare opportunity to live within walking distance of Temple Bar, Grafton Street, St. Stephen's Green, and a wide variety of retail, cultural, and recreational amenities.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and benefits from electric heating, a private balcony, and a fitted kitchen. The property is offered unfurnished, giving prospective purchasers the flexibility to furnish and personalise the space to their own taste.\r\n\r\n\r\nInvestors would benefit from full market rent circa €24,000 per annum, giving a double digit yield.\r\n\r\nManagement fees circa €1613 p.a."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall leading to a galley kitchen and a bright, open-plan living, dining area with access to a private balcony.  A double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and a main bathroom, complete with a bath and overhead shower, complete the layout.  Viking Harbour is a secure, gated residential development with well-maintained communal areas and a peaceful riverside setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D1"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "It offers excellent access to all areas of the city, with a host of public transport options nearby, including Heuston Train Station, the Red LUAS Line, and multiple Dublin Bus routes. Its central location provides exceptional convenience for  working in the city or anyone seeking easy access to major transport hubs. This apartment will appeal to those looking for a low-maintenance, centrally located home within a respected and well-managed development."
      }
    ],
